message: "If you use MedOrigin (formerly MedScale) in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "MedOrigin (formerly MedScale): Verifiable medical AI research infrastructure"
abstract: >-
  MedOrigin (formerly MedScale) develops reproducible, evidence-oriented medical AI
  research infrastructure and a local-first clinical workspace foundation. The current
  research workflows are synthetic-only; no clinical readiness or model training is implied.
